<title>NORWAY: ALPINE SKIING-SUPER-G DELAYED BY RAIN.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-SUPER-G DELAYED BY RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>KVITFJELL, Norway 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The start of a men's Alpine World Cup super-G on Sunday has been delayed 30 minutes because of rain and fog.</p>
<p>The race, the second of the day following a downhill run in the morning, has now been rescheduled for 1230 GMT.</p>
<p>Two races were scheduled for Sunday after high winds forced the postponment of Saturday's downhill.</p>
